@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
actor Server
participant "FCM / APNs" as Push
participant "OS push subsystem" as OS
participant "Kernel / radio" as Kernel
participant "System service" as Svc
participant "App runtime" as App
Server -> Push : send push
Push -> OS : provider delivery
OS -> Kernel : network event / wake
Kernel -> Svc : dispatch event
Svc -> App : resume / launch if eligible
App -> Server : fetch authenticated content
@enduml
